   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Outcome</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced institutional capacity at provincial and national levels to manage natural resource utilization in a sustainable manner.</narrative>
   </description>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 2</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">ANR policy analysis is improved (main sector issues being addressed) 
Progress/Status: MAF showed strong commitment to initiate policy research and consultations to assess success factors in achieving its 5-year development plan. The Government adopted the Public-Private-community partnership concept of the Project to encourage grassroots to set up farmer production groups in the Lao PDR. 
Data Source: Y 
Base year: 2009 
Baseline value: N</narrative>
    </description>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2015-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2015-12-31"></period-end>
    </period>
   </indicator>
