    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">By project completion:

Land-based investments are economically viable, financially sustainable and incorporate social and environmental safeguard analyses 
Progress/Status: Assessment of 71 subprojects being implemented shows that the investments are economically viable, financially sustainable and incorporate social and environmental safeguard analyses. 
Data Source: Y 
Base year: 2009 
Baseline value: N</narrative>
    </description>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2015-01-01"></period-start>
